SUMMARY:Weekend away! Algonquin!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMeetup Location: 95 Partridge
  Run Lane\, killaloe!\nGet together for a weekend in Algonquin!\nCho has g
 enerously offered her cottage up to members for the weekend.\nBring your t
 ent and camp outside but you can use the kitchen and bathrooms.\n(Inside t
 here is room for 8 but leaders get priority.😀)\nThere is water and hiki
 ng and if you are interested in kayaing there are three to use or bring yo
 ur own.\nSaturday is a potluck so bring enough to share along with paper p
 lates.\nIf you are camping we have room for 15 tents.\nThere is a $10. Fee
  to be paid in advance in\nafter August 1.
