SUMMARY:Staying Close to Home..Doris Mcarthy Trail
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nLocation: 201 Guildwood Pkwy\
 n(The pin for the location is acting up so go by the address please!)\nWe 
 have been far and wide this summer from Italy to Tofino BC including the w
 est coast trail.\nNow it's time to stay close to home!\n\n**Get to know th
 e waterfront with Angie and get one of the last swims of the summer in!**\
 n\nDoris McCarthy Trail has beautiful views of the water and lots of wildl
 ife. This is mostly flat except the beginning which includes a bit of a st
 eep hill. It takes approximately 10 minutes to walk down to the lake and a
 fter that the route goes east and west along the water.\nBring a bathing s
 uit if you want to jump in - this is a perfect Sunday hike.\nDistance is a
 bout 13km.
